Highlights:
- Successful deployment of the project management system in the role of a process analyst;
- scrupulous annual maintenance of indicators and metrics (collection, analysis, and reporting of productivity indicators) of a large-scale project management system;
- assistance to colleagues from different departments (10+) in adapting to the new system.

Moreinfo:
Business Development Managed with 5 years of experience in sales and team management.  Accomplished in representing the company at International Business Week.

Good at: 
- Sales. Building relationships, identifying opportunities, and helping customers reach their goals
- Implementing an effective sales process, and maintaining supportive relationships with other departments. 

Previous experience: 
- Establishing a worldwide relationship between business partners by achieving compromise and goals together;

- Working with partners and internal teams (sales, customer success, marketing, legal, product, and engineering) to optimize joint selling and marketing strategies for driving revenue through the partner ecosystem;

- Developing and expanding ecosystem of partners; 
- Attending international conferences and events.

10+ years experience in the sector of technologies and solutions with sales on enterprise level in multinational corporation with 150+ offices worldwide. You'll gain most effect if I lead what i'm doing the best:
- Business development (strategy for growing from scratch, new markets, new niches, new customer clusters, new distribution channels);
- Sales (B2B, ABM, negotiations, farming new partners/customers, long term and high value global deals, sales management, battle for marketshare);
- Project management (customer business migration to our technology platform involving hundreds of staff and offices locally and worldwide, launch of locally designed and supported products with distribution on new markets worldwide, local distribution of global solutions);
- Key Account Management (management of global and high value customers, client relationship management, CRM, cross sales).

Degrees in Psychology and in Diplomacy + years of experience perform my strong skills of negotiator, relationship builder and deal closer. This best fits for relationship management and building the trust and the confidence with clients. And this is the way for success and long term cooperation. 

MBA + years of experience in business management perform my skills of strong team player, manager of business processes and decision maker in highly competitive environment.

Account executive/Business Development  manager (august 2020-till now) 
IT company
- Planning, strategy, marketing and an exclusive approach to each client;
- Sale of the entire portfolio of services of the company;
- Creation of long-term and strong partnerships with clients (C-level executives, Owners);
- Work with a complex IT product, average check from $ 50000 +;
- Execution of a personal plan by 100-150%;
- Presentation of business solutions and negotiation with potential clients;
- Increasing sales through additional cross-selling;
- Use of different sales techniques;
- Maintaining communication between the client and all internal departments;
- Ensuring cooperation with partners during the implementation of the project.

Head Of International Sales (2018 – aug 2020) IT
• Execution of a personal plan by 100-150%
• Work with a complex IT product, average check from € 2000
• Organization and control of the work of sales managers (10+ people)
• Compilation of motivation/KPI for employees.
• Experience in the B2B and B2C segment
• Regular practice in writing sales scripts for various pains and customer objections
• Individual approach and training for each employee of the team.
• Conducting interviews, recruiting new sales managers into the team, support for the adaptation period.

Head of Sales (2016-2017)
• Analysis of the KPI indicator, building a work strategy
• Staff recruitment, training and adaptation
• Check the qualifications of department employees
• Execution of the sales plan of all departments
• Work with the logistics department
• Compilation of motivation systems for sales department
