candidate_profile:
Position:
Accountant/Financial Manager

Moreinfo:
I have been working as an accountant for over 11 years, with 7 of those years work in IT companies.  My main responsibilities include:
1. Management accounting in Xero;
2. Preparing and issuing invoices to clients, as well as processing payments to suppliers (BoA, Wise, Payoneer, Bill.com);
3.Calculating monthly payments to contractors;
4.Preparing and analysing monthly financial reports, including Profit and Loss (P&L) and Cash Flow statements;
5.Communicating with international accountants and providing them with data for tax filings;  
6. Executing contracts and (NDAs) with contractors through Docusign;  
7. Generating various reports upon management's request;
8. Full accompaniment private-entrepreneurs (including opening/closing, bank support).

Looking For:
I prefer to work remotely. My goal is to enhance my skills and contribute to the company's success.

Highlights:
I have experience in creating management accounting from scratch. I worked in a company where, in addition to accounting, I managed more than 60 PEs.

