candidate_profile:
Position:
Application Security Engineer

Moreinfo:
5+ years experiance in IT
1.5+ year experience in information security
During my work as a security specialyst i've done:
Internal and external audit - search and mitigation of risks in the field of information security; 
Monitoring and control of access procedures, monitoring of security events; 
Analysis and preparation of recommendations to increase the level of information security Implements and maintains software and hardware information security complexes;
Monitoring corporate software for malicious behavior. Vulnerability analysis on pre-production and production environment;
Conducting Security Training and Awareness;
Assisting with assessment and integration of cloud vendors and SaaS from information security requirements perspective;
Collaborating closely with Security Vendors and researching the solutions that fits our needs to implement it in company;
Developing information security documentation;
Conducting an incident tracking and participating in incident response team.

