candidate_profile:
Position:
CISO, Head of security, Lead security engineer

Moreinfo:
Responsible for the strategic leadership of the company's information security program;
Develop security goals, define security strategies, metrics, and information security roadmap in support of business goals;
Assist in new product development, adjusting strategy as necessary to recognize new threats introduced with new products;
Pre-sales activities;
Leading information security team;
Implementing security in the Software Development Life Cycle (S-SDLC);
Management and implementation of security processes; 
Information security assessment and audit;
Pentest web/mobile/api/network/infrastructure;
Threat modeling and risk assessment;
Implementing security in ci/cd
Vulnerability management;
Compliance with GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001, SOC2, SWIFT

