Highlights:
- 14 years of work experience;
- 11 years in Business Intelligence and Data Analysis in TOP companies;
- 8 years of work experience with TOP managers and Business Owners;
- Microsoft Certified Professional in BI Reporting and Data Analysis (MCSA - exams - 778, 779, MCDAA - exam - PL-300), additionally Microsoft Certified: Azure Data Fundamentals (exam - DP-900);
- Implementation of Business Intelligence system in 2 biggest (in their fields) companies - from scratch.

What could you get:
- 14 years of work experience in analysis and management (including managerial positions) in fields: Commerce (Retail: DIY, FMCG, fashion), Finance, IT, Marketing, iGaming;
- Power BI – it’s amazing and complex BI application (professionals would understand me – DAX, M) all-in solution to business needs in analysis and solving issues, the popularity of which is skyrocketing. You’ll get top knowledge and technics in this field;
- Also, I have a passion to Python, Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, XGBoost, CatBoost, PyCaret, Prophet, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Plotly).

