Position:
Content writer | Marketing communications writer | Content marketing manager | Copywriter | Digital communications | UX Writer

Moreinfo:
Digital communications manager
Amway, April 2021 – November 2021
- managing the migration of the website Amway.ua to the Hybris platform;
- updating and creating content for the site (product pages, brand pages, banners);
- development of communication for support new product releases and promos;
- SEO-optimization;
- translation and proofreading.

Content Marketer
Artforma, September 2019 – September 2020
- planning content marketing strategies for beauty brands;
- creation of a monthly corporate magazine (articles, promos, interviews);
- writing PR articles, press releases, texts for email newsletters, event announcements;
- content planning and writing materials for social networks.

Copywriter
Public Organization "Kyiv Smart City", May 2019 – August 2019
- writing articles (activities of Kyiv Smart City, urban infrastructure, smart cities, ecology, energy efficiency, IT, transport, etc.);
- writing press releases, announcements, posts for social networks;
- conducting interviews.

Editor
Travel magazine "Around the world. Ukraine", February 2016 – May 2019
- development of the rubricator and the subject of the portal from scratch;
- daily monitoring of news on English-language resources, translation and writing of unique articles;
- cooperation with travel bloggers;
- conducting interviews;
- creation of special projects (for a specific event and by order of the advertiser);
- layout of materials in Tilda;
- social media moderation;
- writing scripts for the YouTube channel, participating in filming.

Highlights:
Skill Highlights: writing articles, project coordination, communication strategy, interview, content management in the admin panel, translation.

As a digital communications manager at Amway, I coordinated the migration of the website to the Hybris platform. Despite the extremely tight deadlines, all tasks were completed on time. I was also involved in supporting the launches of new products and promos, and partly in the SEO optimization of the site.

As a content marketer at Artforma, I developed a communication strategy for the beauty brands, created a monthly corporate magazine, and was engaged in influence marketing.

As an editor of the travel magazine, I created unique content, interviewed travel bloggers, launched special projects, and wrote scripts for YouTube videos.

Knowledge of Outlook, Teams, Canva, Tilda, WIX, Trello, Jira.

