Highlights:
Created effective communication strategy which resulted in ULCRR’s membership in SCAPR (my company is the only Ukrainian member of SCAPR);
	Signed 39 bilateral agreements with CMOs from 31 countries;
	Established effective data exchange and payment document flow to implement bilateral agreements.

CV:
Created effective communication strategy which resulted in ULCRR’s membership in SCAPR (my company is the only Ukrainian member of SCAPR);
	Signed 39 bilateral agreements with CMOs from 31 countries;
	Established effective data exchange and payment document flow to implement bilateral agreements.
Communications professional with over 10 years of experience in Public Relations, corporate and media communications. Managed corporate communications both domestically and internationally, including collaboration with international organizations (SCAPR, IFPI, WIPO) at the leading Ukrainian CMO which manages rights to 70% of music played in Ukraine. 
EXPERIENCE
Ukrainian League of Copyright and Related Rights (ULCRR)
International Communications Manager 				        January 2019 – present

ULCRR is the largest collective management organization (CMO) in Ukraine: over 30 000 000 UAH of royalty collection per year, manages catalogue of over 3 million recordings, a member of SCAPR.

Duties:
Increased awareness of the brand and improved the reputation of the organization among global partners:
•	Created and managed communication strategy with international organizations (SCAPR, IFPI, CISAC, WIPO, APCA);
•	Created presentations, speeches, annual reports, developed key company messages,  provided analytical information for surveys of international organizations (SCAPR, IFPI);
