candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Hello,
For the past four years, I've been developing and supporting projects related to supply chain and demand forecasting in retail, integration projects.
Combine the role of product owner and business analyst.

My key responsibilities:
•	gathering, analyzing and documenting customer's requirements;
•	writing detailed product specifications (User stories and Use-cases);
•	creating interactive prototypes for customers and development team;
•	prioritizing tasks, backlog management;
•	using agile and waterfall methodologies;
•	leading sprint planning meeting, PBR, Daily scrum meeting, Demo;
•	planning, organizing and conducting business process reengineering

Looking For:
I am interested in challenging projects and new technologies.

