Looking for a job in customer service or in recruiting

Moreinfo:
I am a qualified specialist in the field of personnel management with almost 3 years of work experience.
Proactivity and focus on the result are traits that best characterize me in my work.
My previous work experience combined the work of a recruiter, personnel manager, career consultant and head of the department.
My achievements in almost three years of experience:
- creating an employment department (system) in EdTech from scratch.
- successfully employed 75% of the students entrusted to me in the IT company for the position of software tester;
- staffing of the enterprise with about 2,000 employees at the level of 90-92%;
- career promotion to the position of head of the recruiting department;
Unfortunately, I did not work in the IT field, but I got to know her very closely at my last place of work when I employed students after IT courses. This experience opened the IT industry for me, I understood its structure and leading trends.
This is a challenge for me, and I want to continue my career in this direction.

As HRD I had such functions:
-  HR-strategy and budgeting;
 - compensations and rewards;
 - talent search and adaptation, role profiles and interviews by competencies, onboarding and motivation;
 - educational programs, concept and implementation of Start IT Schools, Schools of Developers and Project Managers;
 - increasing staff involvement, motivational programs;
 - team estimation using surveys, 360 survey;
 - organization of events focused on team and HR-brand (training events and corporate events for 200-500 people);
 - communication policy.

Also I worked as a Recruitment lead who had to create a team from very beginning.

The results of cooperation: 
- Team of 2 recruiters and 2 talent searchers. 
- Onboarding and teaching the team
- Welcome board, communication and hierarchy policies
- Help with HR SCHOOL coordination, engagement as a speaker, case-studies organization
- Coordination of day-to-day recruiting processes
- Communication with clients, meetings and briefs
- Communication with candidates, prescreens
- Reports on KPIs and week results  

Worked with HURMA, Breezy and other helpful tools.

Looking For:
•	Clear project/company goals are a must; 
•	No micromanagement but reasonable management supervision; 
•	Respective attitude to all team members

