candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst, Product manager

Moreinfo:
2 years of experience as a Business Analyst in an outsourcing company, 2 years experience as a Sales/BD manager.
3 years of successfully running own online store.
Interested in the position as Business Analyst or Product Manager.

Pre-sales activities:
- Analysis of clients' RFPs and identify client needs and key business requirements;
- Eliciting user, system, and solution requirements on pre-sales activities and discovery phases;
- Taking part in preparing project and solutions estimates with technical leads;

Project activities:
- Functional requirements elicitation, validation, verification and maintenance;
- User stories/ Acceptance criteria creation;
- Identifying and documenting assumptions, constraints, in- and out-of-scope, diagrams, user flows, BPMNs, and wireframes creation;
- Writing project documentation

Passed courses in Business Analysis (IAMPM and Art of BA).

Looking For:
Interesting and dynamic position with challenging tasks and responsibilities in the company. Opportunity for personal and professional development and career growth.

