Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
5+ years of experience in Information technology industry

Work with business, transitional, functional, and non-functional requirements;
Map and analyze business processes, identify inefficiencies, and propose improvements;
Gathering requirements through interviews, benchmarking, focus groups, and questionnaires;
Validation and verification of requirements;
Writing specifications, user stories, and acceptance criteria and evaluating them;
