Position:
Accountant

Moreinfo:
- Verification and reconciliation of accounting records, including debtors and creditors ledgers, tax 
balances such as VAT account, corporate income tax, withholding tax, etc.;
- Preparation and submission of management accounting reports; 
- Control of cash flow and bank balances;
- Preparation and review of financial and tax statements;
- Preparation of accounting and tax advices for clients;
- Plan, direct and coordinate work activities of Junior colleagues;
- Plan, assign and oversee tasks carried out by Junior colleagues;
- Liaising with clients with regard to day-to-day routine matters;
- Participation in conference calls and meetings with clients.

