Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
I have experience as business analyst on various projects for different domains: banking, insurance, trade, constructions, medicines, fashion, communication, transport, security etc.
Im responsible for defining business needs , modeling business processes, using different notations (BPMN, UML, Flowcharts, EPC), eliciting problems and their solving, participation in testing, close interaction with development and testing teams
Key Functions:
- Elicitation and Analysis of business requirements;
- Clarification of requirements with business customers, defining business need;
- Modeling business processes, using different notations (BPMN, UML, Flowcharts);
- Preparing technical documentation for developers;
- Preparing of demonstration sessions on work accomplished;
-Trainings for customers.

Looking For:
interesting projects, professional grows, good practice etc.

