Position:
COO, interim CEO, Head of Delivery

Moreinfo:
14+ years of managerial experience. 7+ years experience as a strategic development/risk management consultant and auditor. Ph.D in Program and Project Management. Corporate MiniMBA (Kyiv Mohyla Business School).

Value-driven strategist, recognised for ability to setup/audit business operations, create and facilitate unique corporate culture, gather, motivate and guide internationally distributed teams to reach Company goals and vision.

Specialities: Program Management, Strategic Management, Client Relations, New Business/Venture Development, Operations Management, Talent Management, Process Audit, Process Improvement, Risk Management, Brand Identity

Looking For:
Dont's:
Please do not contact me with PM/SPM/DM/SDM/SM positions or their equivalents, let's value each other's time.

