Position:
Build Engineer

Moreinfo:
Systems Engineer offering 12+ years of hands-on experience in the IT industry with a key current focus on DevOps.
Background in administration of all types of MS Windows and Linux servers at the enterprise level.
Experience with Docker, CI tools (Jenkins), AWS, Terraform.
Have a good troubleshooting experience and root-cause analysis.
Virtualization technology: VMware, ProxMox
Programming and Scripting: Bash, C++, PowerShell, SQL
Databases: MS SQL, MySQL, PostgreSQL (administration)
Web-servers (Apache, nginx, IIS)
Team management experience (up to 15 team members)
Great communication skills. Team oriented and ready to learn new technologies
English level: B1 (actively studying, ready for intensive courses)

