Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Summary:

Performing requirements analysis and ensuring that requirement statements are complete, consistent, concise, comprehensible, traceable;
Entering, manipulating, and reporting on requirements stored in requirements management tools;
Managing changes to baselined requirements through effective application of established change control processes and tools;
