Moreinfo:
•	25+ years of management experience with international and domestic organisations, programs and projects;
•	Has been at the forefront of developing new initiatives and new products, coupled with the experience of setting up network and cooperation in Ukraine and abroad;
•	Excellent in building of great customer relations;
•	Strong team-leader and reliable team player.

CV:
- “Information Society of Ukraine” Foundation: opened first in Ukraine non-for-profit center for IT Education of secondary school administration to boost IT literacy and Information Society development in the country. Trained 300+ target group representatives just in 1 year.
- US Peace Corps: designing absolutely new content, creating ideology and policy for Youth Development program to teach disadvantaged young Ukrainians technology and life skills that will help them to participate fully in the rapidly changing economy and society of Ukraine. Placed nationwide 150+ volunteers, equipped with tools & knowledge for their mission. Just in half a year.
- Microsoft: Academic sales strategy development and its implementation in Ukraine. Sales growth from 0,6M to 4,4M USD just in 1 year.
- Joint World Bank, WWF and IUCN Forest Law Enforcement and Governance program. Coordinating communications and creating links between IT and actual implementation. Building innovative communication-information exchange platform for participation of experts. 2 years.
- "Delcam" Ural: creating collaboration environment between different departments to improve internal communication and business processes within the company, causing increased quality of sales staff trainings and management, better targeting of marketing activities and general HR policy. 1,5 year.
•	25+ years of management experience with international and domestic organisations, programs and projects;
•	Has been at the forefront of developing new initiatives and new products, coupled with the experience of setting up network and cooperation in Ukraine and abroad;
•	Excellent in building of great customer relations;
•	Strong team-leader and reliable team player.
There is key principle: always try to work with people, who has positive attitude and lead team together to build better conditions for our productive life.

Moreinfo:
More than 10+ years of experience in finances on a leading position as a CFO and Manager of FP&A/Accountant departments. Chartered certified professional with combined experience in multinational information/financial technology companies.
 Hold an associate membership of the Institute of Financial Accountants (UK) & Institute of Public Accountants (AU). Highly skilled in financial analysis, financial reporting, management accounting, corporate finance, budgeting and strategic planning. 
Passionate for building strong and effective teams, optimizing business processes, providing financial support and producing strategic recommendations and providing high quality services to a key business stakeholders. Experienced as a Project Manager of SAP implementation (4 years), BAS ERP(1C) implementation with integration to Corp/Bank/CRM systems for UA legal entities. Standardization, automatization and optimization of processes within responsibility ‘own’ and “drive” the process design from start to finish.
Chartered Accountant with an engrained understanding of accounting standards under IFRS, US GAAP and UA GAAP. 

Key Specialties:
• Financial Controlling, Reporting & Analysis;
• Budgeting & Forecasting;
• Management Reporting;
• Auditing & Investigation;
• Financial Software Implementation (SAP, 1C BAS, Tableau & Power BI tools, Zoho CRM system)

candidate_profile:
Position:
CFO / Finance Adviser / Finance & Operations Consultant

Moreinfo:
7 years of experience in international IT companies in finance, 2 as CFO/COO. Can build and optimize financial processes for your company (payroll, invoicing/billing, reporting - you name it), train your staff, implement accounting system (in google sheets or through the software depending on needs and transactions number). Provide management with advising and support not only in finance but all operational management. Have experience in managing operations processes (HR, recruitment, shared resources management including resource management system development and implementation). 
Skills and experience: - Processes implementation and control; - Team hiring and management; - Business processes development and optimization; - Financial/management advising and support for owners and top management; - Pricing modeling; - Managerial accounting; - Budgeting; - Reports preparation and analysis (P&L, revenue and GM analysis, CIR analysis, budget usage etc); - Controlling skills: payments, payroll activities, invoicing, general data validation and check in accounting system.

Looking For:
Ready to help businesses work more effective and ensure profitability and costs optimization in short and long term perspectives.

Highlights:
- Have built management accounting system and 80% of other financial processes (billing, reporting, budgeting, resource management  etc) from scratch for IT company (70+ employees, outsource);
- Created HR department (including recruitment) strategy and team composition for IT company (70+ employees, outsource);
- Created resource management & projects overview system for IT company (70+ employees, outsource);
- Have been in charge of forecasting, controlling and financial advising for delivery unit in IT company (1800+ employees, outsource);
- Successfully optimized bunch of internal financial processes and procedures, including work with documents, data analysis, data validation, reports preparation etc.

English Level:
upper

Experience Years:
7.0

