Moreinfo:
Managing various transversal activities in an R&D Company (multiproduct, ~150 staff members, 12 scrum teams, 1 subordinate): 
- Managing company-wise processes design and
Optimization; 
- Coordinating R&D Budgeting and Resource planning; 
- Building compliance with ISO 27k and 9k requirements, Leading Int and Ext Audits; 
- Handling Asset and Access management; 
- Driving Risk management, SW Maintenance and other processes and transversal activities.

- 22+ years experience in IT industry as a project portfolio manager;
- Strong skills in Project Management (PMBoK, PRINCE2, SCRUM) and IT (CoBIT, ITIL/ITSM, ISO 27001, TOGAF & Zachman Framework Architectures);
- Software development lifecycle knowledge RUP, SDLC, Agile
- Applied internal controls principles and implemented Risk Management System on COSO framework based, project and IT risks;
- Excellent people management, leadership & organization skills;
- Knowledge and experience in application of various software project management methodologies & models.

