candidate_profile:
Position:
Analyst

Moreinfo:
I'm a highly motivated and results-driven analyst. I use the power of analytical thinking to spot insights in any sort and amount of financial data and bring automation to streamline the companies' processes. 

My strong suit:
 Experienced in forming business development strategies: creating and developing new directions, calculation of profitability, recoupment periods, financial, market, and noneconomic risk factors; developing pricing policy;
 Skilled in numerous financial and accounting fields, including preparing annual budgets, monitoring key accounts and credit control;
 Able to handle complex assignments effectively and possess the confidence to work as part of a team or independently;
 Strong analytical skills.

