candidate_profile:
Position:
BI/SQL/DWH Developer

Moreinfo:
Experienced in database and business intelligence solutions development. Strong skills in MS SQL Server, T-SQL, SSRS, SSIS, VBA.
Key responsibilities:
- Development of SSRS reports;
- Configuration and administration of SSRS;
- ETL development using SSIS;
- Development of Looker dashboards;
- Optimization database performance;
- Development of stored procedures, functions, views, triggers, indexes for MS SQL Server, Oracle, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Sybase IQ, Snowflake;
- Development and monitoring of jobs in MS SQL Server;

Also I have basic working experience with next technologies: SSAS, AWS, Airflow, Tableau, Power BI.

Looking For:
- Looking for projects to master my skills in the business intelligence area and to work with one of the modern BI tools.
- Interested in the projects with cloud-based technologies
- Not interested in the projects where main part of the work is to maintain legacy code and systems.

