- Strong understanding of the Discovery process, including pre-sale activities, elicitation techniques, and market and competitor research;
- Extensive experience in creating and updating software development life cycle (SDLC) processes;
- Deep knowledge of user experience (UX) and user interface (UI) testing, including ready-made solutions and real-time communication;
- Strong understanding of development and testing processes;
- Experienced in Agile methodologies such as Scrum and Kanban, as well as Waterfall methodology

Overall, I'm a reliable and innovative problem solver, always striving for the best 
possible outcome for my products and teams.

