- created and was in charge of the company’s web presence on the digital platforms (Blog - over 30 unique articles and interviews, offers to clients - over 10, landings for business needs - over 15, etc), including social media ones such as Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter (2-3 posts weekly); 
-planned and implemented marketing campaigns, along coordinating work with the designer, SEO, head of digital marketer, and project manager; 
- performed the analysis of the market, competitors and identified the new content strategy (increased online traffic on average by 80% in 6 months); 
 monitored and analyzed the performance of new marketing campaigns; formed, tested new hypotheses; outlined further work plans, determined resources, and wrote timelines; 
- work in close collaboration with the other departments of the company (design, SEO, SMM, engineering teams) at all stages of our client’s product creation from idea to launch and further development.
Good work atmosphere, people around, career opportunities, flexible schedule

