candidate_profile:
Position:
Content writer, copywriter, content editor, editor-in-chief,

Moreinfo:
I am a highly-motivated, committed, and ambitious content writer with experience in the tech, iGaming, and crypto industries. I strive to develop my skills and grow professionally in the field of content creation in IT.

I have eight months of experience as an editor-in-chief at a B2B online media about iGaming, crypto, and digital marketing. My responsibilities included: 
 - Managing a team of two copywriters;
- Developing a strategic content plan and content calendar;
- Creating various types of content;
- Editing and revising content for social media and website;
- Closely working with marketing, design, sales, and analytical teams;
- Organizing and moderating online webinars and conferences, etc. 

Furthermore, I have over a year of experience as a journalist and copywriter in the iGaming and crypto fields. At the time, I was creating relevant content for an online media outlet on a daily basis. Some of the content formats I worked with include - news articles, SEO articles, press releases, case studies, analytical articles, and interviews. My job also required daily communication with SEO specialists, designers, and sales managers. 

Not only that, but I also have Chinese-Enghlish translation background and experience in customer support, and freelance copywriting. While working at these jobs, I improved problem-solving, stress resistance, and communication skills.

Highlights:
- Successfully managed a team of copywriters;
- Created engaging content that helped increase website's bounce rate and number of page views;
- Organized two-day online conference with overall audience of 500+ people.

English Level:
fluent

Experience Years:
2.0

