Moreinfo:
As a professional Content and Social Media Marketing Manager, I have taken a full responsibility on writing an original content, interpreting briefs, sharing posts and stories on social media channels and so on.

Regarding related technology, in addition to social media channels, I also use some technological tools, such as:
1. Meta Business Suite for scheduling posts;
2. Trello for organizing daily tasks;
3. Google Sheet for monthly content planning;
4. Yandex Mail for strengthening relationships with our customers, etc.

Finally, I would like to improve myself in Digital Markerting or Design. I have recently started to watch some videos, but that may not be enough for working as in the beginning, I may need an assistance on tasks. No matter I do not have an experience in this side of Marketing, I am open to your internship offers.

Regardless of having an on-site job, I am actively applying for remote or freelance jobs and completely ready and excited about your offers. Feel free to contact me if you think I am perfectly suited for the position.

