Moreinfo: Project management:
- Worked as a part of Project Management Office;
- Analyzed the implementation process of projects in order to minimaze the delay and dismissal of key results;
- Checked reports of project managers in terms of accuracy and completeness;
- Created reports of project portfolio of NBU quaterly and yearly;
- Tested configurations of Jira&Confluence;
- Implemented 3 courses for different groups of participants on the topic of Project management via Jira&Confluence.

Compliance specialist:
- Work as a part of AML team;
- Make the Bank work in accordance with local and Group AML and Compliance legislation (update and create internal banking documents, procedures);
- Responsible for preparing and sending of statistical forms to National Bank of Ukraine;
Initiate IT developments that simplify processes and replace manual work (prepare business requests, work with analysits on functional specifications, take part in user testing);
- Take part in Credit Agricole Group initiatives and projects.

Business analyst:
- Writing and consolidating demands of involved parties
- Working with FBL and Data Model
- Basic knowledge of management tools (JIRA & Confluence)
- Basic knowledge of Python, SQL
- Participating in user testing
English Level: fluent
Experience Years: 2.0
