candidate_profile:
Position:
Business analyst

Moreinfo:
10.2013 – 10.2014  - as a leading economist of PAT KB “Bank Finance and Credit” (also acting head of the branch)
-  servicing of legal entities: opening of current accounts in foreign and national currency, SCS, client bank, lending jur. persons that Service of individuals: crediting, opening and maintaining current and card accounts in foreign and national currencies, registration of deposits. Customer identification, financial monitoring, international transfers, internet banking, document management, consulting services. attracting customers;
- knowledge of banking products;
 - knowledge of service standards;
- work with computer;
- Tracking social payments and enrollments from the PFU. Knowledge of the legislation of Ukraine, banking instructions. Responsibility for the order of registration of banking operations in the department, control of banking transactions. Filling out reports on currency conversion, branch deposit portfolio.
- the cash register, the audit of the cashier, the order of reinforcements, collection, the sale of cash to other banks.
 11.2014-07.2017- Head of the sector Micro Small and Medium business of Bank “Oschadbank”. searching and attracting new clients to the bank, holding meetings and negotiations with the owners and top officials of companies, meeting the bank’s business targets, selling Bank products to companies, organizing and monitoring loan processing. Opening current, deposit and card accounts, their further support, lending , transfer of funds through the SWIFT system, installation of POS-terminals, management of payroll projects, accreditation of notaries, implementation of foreign exchange control of foreign economic activity from legal entities Skim persons conducting export-import operations.
08.2017 - Manager for work with VIP-corporate clients of PAT KB PrivatBank. The function of the middle office in the implementation of active operations - preparation of credit business, validation and analysis of a package of documents, elimination of legal comments, preparation of protocols of the Credit Committee and ensuring the implementation of its conditions. Organization of signing documents and contractual base for active operations.
08.2019 - to date, VIP manager of AT "KredoBank".  Attracting individual customers to the Bank's services, selling a full range of banking products in a dedicated client segment; developing commercial relations with a dedicated portfolio of high-potential clients;

