Moreinfo:
Since 2015 I'm an Owner and maintainer of a trading platform based on social networks and messengers. 
Job description:
- development of platform concept and monetization;
- working on business growth;
- risks diversification;
- new features requirements specification and implementation.
As a result there are more than 85 thousand platform users at the moment.
Have a 7 years (2007-2013) experience in Banking (Small and Medium Enterprises mostly). 
I've started my career as Credit expert of Small and Medium Business Services Department (search for new clients and their loan ability consultancy; documents collection and analysis for deals, borrower’s financial state analysis according to the IPC method; participation in committees of borrower’s lending ability; compilation of deals documents and agreements) and have grown to Head of Small and Medium Enterprises credit risks analysis Department (department work coordination (6 subordinates); document package and borrowers’ financial state analysis (legal entities and entrepreneurs with an annual turnover up to 30 million UAH); making recommendations on lending operations, their restructuring and modification taking into account and minimizing possible risks, submitting the issue to the Head Office Credit Committee; improvement and participation in development of all products/processes/methods for the issuance, restructuring and modification of retail and SME businesses credit operations. 
My last bank position was Head of Corporate business credit operations administration Department and the general task for me on this position was project creation and development to centralize credit administration functionality (requirements collection, its alignment and implementation, process development, logistics, budget and responsibilities.

