candidate_profile:
Position:
Business/System Analyst

Moreinfo:
Work experience in banking/finance and risk:
• preparation of Functional Specifications to IBM Integration Bus (BPMN notations, UML-
diagrams, SOAP, REST, web service with JSON, XML), tracking in Confluence;
• methodological support, development and improvement of technical documentation;
• basic knowledge about SOA, hands-on experience in Business Process Analysis and System.
Analysis (projects - client bank, NBU), system integration via ESB;
• preparing cases for testing integrated process flows with other systems (SoapUI, Postman);
• participation in the management and supervision of the program (analysis of problems,
consulting, preparation of tools, giving recommendations);
• Implementation of Pre-,Soft-,Hard-Collection processes on the basis of CRM system, development of  business-demands and schemes together with models of mechanisms work (calculation of the segments) of full cycle interaction of the bank with the borrowers;
• creation of technical requirements for automation of risk processes (scoring) and operations;
• take part in project of creation front/back-offices, as Project Manager.

Work experience other:
• development MVP for CRM;
• tasks for developing backend web services;
• search of external integrators and conducting of negotiations, maintenance of the contract on development of software.

Looking For:
My prefer projects in financial, risk, transaction card, medical, mobile application areas

