A finance manager with an experience of problem solving within the marine transporation industries. Responsible and results-focused. Had two people under my guidance. Certified business analyst (IT industry).

**Work experience:**

Finance manager
July 2018 – December 2021

1. Work using 1C “Commercial Enterprise Management”, “Logistics” (bank payment documents, orders, purchases, realization,  analysis, trial balance etc.;
2. Monthly preparation of debtors and creditors liability by degree of overdue;
3. Daily organization of  the payments plan  in Excel and the head department approval;
4. Work using online e-banking systems within legal entities (banks in Switzerland, Latvia and  Montenegro). Checking the accuracy of the collected payments by an assistant, coordination with the head of the department and sending;
5. Preparation of the responses to banking inquiries in English;
6. Accounting of the ships’ fuel and oil using 1C program (purchase, transferring , write-off, turnover);
7. Collection of data for  the management reports by groups of companies;
