Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Experience:
More than 7 years in IT industry on such positions as functional and business analyst in banking area (over 12 years). Solid experience in team management, mentoring and coaching. Strong communication and analytics skills combined with experience of client expectations and requirements management. 
