candidate_profile:
Position:
Automation QA Engineer (C# + Selenium)

Moreinfo:
- 6+ years of experience in Software Quality Assurance;
- 4+ years of experience in AQA;
- ISTQB certifications: Foundation, Advanced Level Test Analyst;
- UI automation testing (Selenium + C#),  I successfully implemented two E2E automation frameworks from scratch;
- Integration (API/DB) automation testing (Refit + C#); 
- Full range of standardized documents for software testing (test plan, test coverage reports, check-lists, test cases, bug reports, etc); 
- Test Planning / Creation / Management / Maintenance / Updating / Analysis
- Agile (Scrum/Kanban) team player experience;
- Knowledge of client-server architecture, a good understanding of HTTP, SDLC; 
- Knowledge of modern automation solution patterns;
- Test design techniques / test types / levels of testing;
- Manual Testing of web and mobile applications;

Looking For:
• Competetive salary and social package
• Flexible working hours
• Friendly team

Highlights:
I’m an ISTQB certified, well-organized, and highly self-driven Automation QA, who is used to providing input from a quality standpoint. I successfully implemented automation frameworks for two SaaS projects based in the US. I’m able to work independently as well as collaborate with different participants of the dev process, taking full responsibility for the test automation process. Using the frameworks the teams achieved major smoke testing time reduction and fully automated regression testing which helped to deliver bug reports ASAP and free up a significant part of resources.

