candidate_profile:
Position:
Automation QA Engineer

Moreinfo:
4+ years of professional experience in the Information Technology industry specializing in Quality Assurance, including manual and automation testing domains. 

Programming Languages: Java, Groovy;
Automation Framework: Selenium, Selenide, REST Assured, Cucumber, Spock, Appium;
Development Environments and Bug Tracking Systems: Confluence, JIRA, GitLab, Azure DevOps, TestRail;
Version Control Systems: Git;
CI/CD environments: Jenkins; 
Integrated Development Environments: IntelliJ IDEA; 
Software Development Methodologies: Scrum, Shift left testing, Kanban;
Platforms: macOS, Windows, Linux;

Responsibilities:
Planning the QA automation process to ensure optimal coverage;
Maintaining the existing automation suite;
Designing tests for new features including web UI and API interfaces;
Performing test runs upon request and on schedule;
Reporting to stakeholders on automation runs;
Bug fixes verification;
Improving the test strategy;
Mentorship newcomers;
Successful achievement of all the set goals.

