I am an expert in qualitative (textual) data analysis. Being a freelancer on Upwork for more than 5 years, I have a lot of experience working with different types of textual data.

Please feel free to contact me if you need:
- Analysis of your open-ended survey responses;
- Thematic analysis of customer feedback;
- Categorization of comments/reviews/tweets etc.;
- Annotation/labeling/tagging of any statements/sentences/claims.

