Head of Market Team and Global Relations Manager at MatchOffice (since 2019)

- Coordinate the Customer Success team of 4 people;
- Identify team goals and evaluate team progress;
- Collect and analyze data to identify industry trends to structure KPIs and identify tactics for team;
- Communicate with clients to shape their program in order to meet their KPIs;
- Sign up new clients;
- Manual and Automated (Zapier) e-mail marketing campaigns;
- Reporting to top management;
- Client surveys management and production;
- Handling bookkeeping, accounting operations.
