Successfully finished EPAM Business Analysis Laboratory and received a Certificate. Learning and working on a project lasted for 6 months. We cooperated closely with PO as a BA Team on creation of educational application. Our goal was to define vision and scope of the Product, Roadmap, define stakeholders and create a Communication Plan, create Mockups. I took active part in creation of various diagrams such as Activity Diagrams, Use Case Diagrams, Flowcharts, BPMN. We created a prioritized Backlog which was ready for development.

Experienced and skillful Customer Support Quality Assurance Team Leader with more than 9 years of working in Customer Support sphere in one of the top domain name registrars Namecheap. Have a big knowledge in team management and development, constructive feedback giving, conflicts and issues solving.

Key Client Projects: Namecheap.com (USA Domain, Hosting and SSL provider).

