Position:
copywriter, translator, content creator

Moreinfo:
-translation of scientific articles/legal documents (in the sphere of space and marine law);
-presentation of projects for international partners; 
-social media content creation ( writing posts and blogs for NEMT software providers);
-copywriting (articles about the benefits of NEMT software, its features, etc);
-proofreading the works of other copywriters, examining and editing them to comply with specific requirements and instructions;
-emailing; 
-experience in customer support

