• Sep.2015-Jan.2021- obtained Bachelor’s and Master’s degree in English philology (German as a second language) at Kyiv National Linguistic University. 
• experience working as an English teacher/tutor 
• Apr.2018-Feb. 2021- translator and interpreter in online negotiations at the Scientific Institute of Public Law. 
• Feb.2022- content creator, copywriter in the sphere of NEMT. The job duties included writing articles about NEMT dispatch software, blogs for company’s websites, press releases, and posts for social media.

