Position:
AQA Engineer

Moreinfo:
• More than 7 years of experience in testing WEB and Mobile applications;
• Writing UI and API automation tests with Selenium WebDriver, Java, and REST-Assured;
• Strong understanding of SDLC, QA Methodology including Agile;
• CI: GitHub Actions, Jenkins
• Responsible for development, maintenance, and execution manual and automation tests;
• Writing easy-to-reproduce bug reports and monitoring their status until satisfactory resolution;
• Proficient in Bug-tracking system by utilizing tools such as JIRA, TestRail, Trello
• Experience in Cross-Platform and Cross-Browser Compatibility testing;
• Strong team player with an ability to work productively in a team as well as individually;
• Well organized and detail-oriented. Keep track of multiple conflicting priorities;
• I am a quick learner and highly adaptable to change, as well as able to interact effectively with others and cope well with high-stress situations;
• Tested application behavior under various interruptions;
• Took part in regular Scrum meetings and discussions with Product Owner, Business Analysts, and developers regarding new features and requirements (User Stories);
• Able to work effectively in a multilingual/multicultural environment.

