CV:
I've worked on a web application for the facilitators' business society in Kazakhstan. Project was based on REST API web services. During this task I have used the following technologies Java, Spring framework (including Spring Boot, Spring Security, Spring JPA, Spring Data, Specifications), relational database PostgreSQL, non-relational database Mongo DB, JavaScript and Svelte framework on front-end, as well as Maven as project builder, JUnit for testing and log4j for logging. For deployment purposes, we used Docker and Docker compose.

Participated in development of full-stack application based on .Net Core and Vue js.
-	Development of full-stack web application based on REST API using .Net Core(C#) / Spring (Java) and Svelte / Vue;
