Cloud Infrastructure Engineer, OPS Engineer

Moreinfo:
Experience in virtualization services: VmWare ESXi, AWS, GCP, KVM, Hetzner, SuperNovo, FusionCompute, FusionAccess, HyperV;
Configuring and integrating hardware storages and backup softwares: Huawei OceanStor Dorado, HP LeftHand, Fujitsu Eternus, Veeam Backup, Commvault Enterprise;
Configuring and integrating hardware servers: HPE ProLiant, DELL-EMC, Huawei family (include Blade E9000), Supermicro;
Experience in configuring environments in in-house Data Center, managing servers and virtual machines;
