candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Business analyst IT Department ERP software - 4 years
Finance domain ( from Account to Deputy Chief accountant) - 12 years

Current position - Middle BA ERP + Support after 1st line + QA.

Current Responsibilities:
-communicating with customers and teams to collect and describe requirements;
-preparing clients' requests for estimation;
-verifying developed software to meet the customer's requirements;
-manual testing;
-organizing validation and acceptance of the software by the customer;
-working with project backlog (prepare, decompose,prioritize);
-proposing solutions, helping customers to create requirements;
-managing knowledge base (writing articles,instructions, policies, and procedures);
-consulting clients for correct usage of 1C ERP software;
-searching for weaknesses in the current process of application lifecycle management and suggestions for its improvement.

Looking For:
I intend to increase the areas of my competence and also I want to find a suitable vacancy in IT company whith good team.

