Position:
Business Analyst/ Data Analyst / Data Science

Moreinfo:
- Knowledge of Python (for Data Science and Data Analysis, visualization);
- SQL, R (basics);
- Basic knowledge of ML;
- Ability to create hypotheses for further research;
