candidate_profile:
Position:
Automation QA Engineer

Moreinfo:
I have a goal to obtain  Automation QA Engineer position to apply my knowledge. Motivated to develop my skills and grow professionally. I passed several QA courses and did practical tasks.

-Good knowledge of testing methodologies and processes; 
-Experience in creating QA documentation: Test Plans, Test Cases,
-Bug Reports, Checklists;
-Basic experience in API testing ; 
-Experience with HTML, CSS;
-Experience with SQL (creation SQL queries); 
-Understanding of client-server architecture, HTTP protocol.

Looking For:
I expect to gain more experience, to grow as a software tester, and become an active, helpful partner in solving the problems, which IT companies face.

Highlights:
I am taking part in testing a web application designed to organize patient visits to medical specialists.
In this application, a display seen by a patient shows a list of specialist doctors with their work schedules. Whereas, a receptionist or hospital administration sees the list of appointments and all the information on special charts. While working on testing this application, I got to know Qase, Postman, Jmeter, SQL and Jira.

