Moreinfo:
Automation Test Portfolio Manager

Responsibilities / Job Role:

- Point of contact for senior leadership stakeholders and cross-functional teams;
- Create and implement goals and action plans to align with overall organization objectives;
- Communicate and adapt presentations to various stakeholders regarding goals, planning process, project initiatives, team innovation and results;
- Implement, gather and report team/project metrics to track execution and effectiveness;
- On-board high caliber test engineers within planned budget and timeline;
- Accountable for the quality of development activities during the release of products to production;
