Work experience: Statistician analyst (1.5 months)
Responsibilities:
• Collect and interpret data;
• Calculate analytical marketing metrics and KPIs (ROI, ARPU, LTV);
• Identify the reasons for the deterioration of metrics;
• Create daily and monthly reports to provide insights to the leadership team.

Highlights:
The best Student of the Year 2020 in Zaporizhzhia Oblast.

I'm a zoo volunteer and founder of animal shelter.

I have received awards for writing scientific articles on the topics:
• "Economic feasibility of solar energy";
• "Dependence of prices on changes in the exchange rate";
• "The peculiarity of the national currency in modern conditions: features and factors of influence".

