Position:
BI Engineer

Moreinfo:
Position: BI engineer
Functional responsibilities:
• Consuming data from various sources, transforming and loading it into
databases;
• Design and support ETL processes;
• Developing and implementation stored procedures, function, CTEs, Views,
Table Relationships;
• Enhancing and maintaining existing reports and dashboards;
• Collaborating with Product teams to identify process improvement
opportunities based on in-depth Bl reviews;
• Working with client's requests(adding new fields/dimensions/metrics and
updating existing, changing logics in the stored procedures, working with
layout of files, improving joinrate between datasets);
• Working in Scrum and Kanban methodology;

Professional skills: SQL, Vertica, OLAP, MS Word, MS Excel, Autocad, Inventor, Mathcad, SolidWorks
Basic knowledge: MDX, XML, Hadoop, SVN version control system, Jira
English level: Intermediate

