candidate_profile:
Position:
CIO, IT-Manager, CDTO, IT-Director, COO for IT-company

Moreinfo:
25 years of Experience in Information Technology, 19 years in management, and 12 years in top positions in industrial manufacturing and telecom industries;
Managed large, distributed business units with 150+ employees and 30+ locations, including remote teams;
Developed IT strategies aligned with business goals and objectives, and implemented ERP systems and business process automation.;
Created new opportunities through IT, and BI reporting systems and adapted them to meet business needs;
Launched internal collaboration services (MSO365, videoconf, internal chats, internal portals, document management systems) and IT-integrated telephone services;
ERP system development and implementation, inventory management, finance, human resources, budgeting, logistics, CAD/CAM;
Optimizing IT costs, streamlined functions, and improved maintenance while exploring alternative solutions and outsourcing; 
Led business digital transformation and process automation;
IT costs optimization, stuff functions unification, maintenance simplification, searching alternative solutions, and functions outsourcing;
Business digital transformation and business processes automation;
Experienced in both Waterfall and Agile IT project management, reduced business downtime and improved system reliability through cloud migration;
Reduced business downtime associated with the operation of IT services;
Organization and management of complex, distributed, highly loaded, and highly critical IT systems with 99.99% availability;
Experience in IT budget management, procurement, and project budgeting, with knowledge of IT security policies. 
Set up IT policies, development, and implementation including IT security;

Looking For:
Big company, big goals, big opportunities

