Highlights:
Pulling through crises remaining profitable and sustainable.
Profitability increase +2%.
Investment projects successfully launched within group of businesses:
–s/m "Vostorg" and "Delight" (Kharkov); 
–rehabilitation center Fortis (Kharkov);
–medical center Fortis Health (Netherlands); written and verbal
communication in English
All the investment projects were launched without financial irregularity.
Drawing up budget and editing forecast enabled efficient management and facilitated dealing with oncoming challenges. Experience of arranging budgeting system from scratch (P&L, CF, BS).
Making monthly reports within 7 days enabled timely decision making. Experience of arranging management accounting from scratch (P&L, CF, BS).
Together with IT department we created and implemented ERP-system (on Oracle database) and BI-analytics which enabled:
–reduced monthly report making term to 7 days;
–enhanced processes (purchasing, range of goods, pricing, service for customers);
–upgraded finance control (payments, additional income, inventory);
–facilitated decision making.
I taught and trained the team of managers modeling situations and finding effective solutions.

