Position:
Copywriter, Content Writer

Moreinfo:
With over six years of writing experience, I am ready to offer the following skills to prospective employers:

-High-profile writing (for blogs, social media, company websites, landing pages, interfaces, user guides, marketing assets, email campaigns, etc.);
