Moreinfo:
WORK EXPERIENCE
Financial Analyst
JAN 2020-AUG 2022, DIGITAL MEDIA BUYING AGENCY
-created an accounting structure of daily information from more than 250 traffic sources;
-monitored all changes in daily statistics and created a system to explain these changes;
-communicated with direct advertisers and affiliate programs about daily statistics and weekly/monthly reports;
-made a payment plan every week;
-worked daily with the company's income and monitored debts;
-discussed partner payments and resolved problematic situations with them;
-organized a team of 4 assistants (starting with the interview and ending with transfer to them part of my duties).

Financial Analyst
AUG 2018-DEC 2019, E-COMMERCE
-added information about the company's operational processes to the CRM and monitored the correctness of the entered data according to various criteria;
-helped the marketing department (worked with marketing reports, calculated on this basis KPI, registered new accounts in teaser networks, updated access, searched for new sources of traffic);
-assisted the CFO (daily added data to the CF report to keep the document up-to-date, helped with the inventory of goods in the warehouse, worked with the company's bank statements, and participated in the quality control of the call center).			

Financial Assistant
MAY 2018-AUG 2018, ADVERTISING AGENCY
I worked with the accounting computer program 1C for Advertising, created financial documentation based on marketing data, and prepared a package of documents for clients.

Executive Assistant and Accountant
NOV 2016-APR 2018, IT-COMPANY
As an Executive Assistant, I planned and implemented corporate holiday parties, ordered household goods and organized the daily work of the office. As an Accountant, I created primary accounting documents in the 1C program, printed documents, sent them to partners and archived signed files. 

INTERNSHIPS
JUL 2016-AUG 2016, NGO
I was a volunteer on the hotline of the university entrance campaign. My responsibilities included: registration of citizens' issues, providing explanations by current legislation and registration of documents. In total, more than 3,000 calls from applicants from all over Ukraine were processed.

FEB 2016-APR 2016, TELECOMMUNICATION COMPANY
During the internship, I made more than 1000 "cold calls" to potential customers of the company, digitized contracts and created a register of these documents.

candidate_profile:
Position:
BI analyst, Data analyst

Moreinfo:
- Coaching and mentoring BI developers and analysts team (5 members);
- Developing strategic, operational dashboards from zero, using Qlik Sense and Power BI, implementing best practices of data modeling (Snowflake, Star Scheme) and visualizations;
- Importing data from PostgreSQL, MSSQL databases using a query (join, aggregation functions);
- Performing ETL processes at the script part while importing data;
- Organizing and designing appropriate data warehouse using QVDs and daily updating data with task planning (QMC) – Fact tables (sales, orders, stock) and dimensions;
- Creating documentation and guidance of dashboards for users.

Highlights:
BI developing:
- In 6 months developed 12 dashboards from zero for 3 group of companies (Retail and Distribution);
- Organizing and designing appropriate data warehouse for more than 1 billion rows data;
Data analysis:
• Active participation in stretch planning processes: sales base cleaning, trade activities and promo calculations, demand planning accuracy, forecasting;
• Improved method of calculating Sell In forecast by categories Mars, Wrigley and Skittles: Demand planning accuracy (DPA) – 98%

