candidate_profile:
Position:
copywriter

Moreinfo:
I was a creative copywriter on my previous work place, but I did not work only on copywriter's tasks. I conducted interviews with candidates, analyzed polls to find the insights. Moreover, I analyzed clients' activities and competitive markets. I created new positioning, role and tone of voice for brands. I made different art-direction tasks, worked on the visual draft for the commercial that my colleagues were developing. Likewise, I created something new, wrote scenarios and final lines, creatives and slogans. I want to continue improving and developing my skills in this field and expand the boundaries of my opportunity.

Looking For:
I'm a fan of advertising, so the vacancy in advertising/ PR/ communication field is a main priority for me. I am also interested in launching new products. I'm not looking for simply writing for web-sites, SMM or email text. I want to create brands, commercials, activities in modern and unique way in order to express my creativity.

Highlights:
I have launched a contest on the agency Instagram page with targeted ad that has increased audience`s involvement and interest;
Independently I have created the internship project for students that were interested in SMM;
There was no designer in the agency, so I improved quality of visual part of the projects. I have developed creatives for targeting that promoted effectivity of ad campaigns;
I have defined the main concept of Koblevo commercial from investigation and survey to scenario, lines and art-direction. Because of that brand has got improved indicators of its acceptance and augmentation of male audience; 
I have written the scenario and shot the short movie together with team. We got the first place at uni competition.

