candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst / Project Manager

Moreinfo:
Employment History
June 2019 to January 2020 – Project Manager at ArtHome, Dnipro/Ukraine
 Preparation of a review of a company, person, vertical analysis
 Creating a site using Tilda filling the site with content.
 Planning and monitoring the project
 Managing project risks, including the development of contingency plans
 Monitoring overall progress and use of resources, initiating corrective action where necessary
 identifying and obtaining support and advice required for the management, planning and control of the project
 Conducting a project evaluation review to assess how well the project was managed
 Preparing any follow-on action recommendations
 Develop and maintain an agreed project plan and detailed stage plans
 Build and sustain effective communications with other roles involved in the project
 Controlling time management
 Cost estimating and developing the budget
 Conclusion of cooperation with Ukrainian artists;
 Representing the interests of the company to interior designers;
 Social networking;
 Supporting relationships with partners.
April 2019 to July 2019 - Researcher (Commercial Intelligence) at Noosphere, Dnipro/Ukraine
 Carrying out vertical research and full niches reviews for future customer product release in the
market;
 Country-specific features analysis;
 Uncovering hidden links and relations between people and businesses;
 Search for information about IT companies, entrepreneurs and events through open source

intelligence;
 Venture capital deals analysis for vertical trends identification.
 Preparation of a review of a company, person, vertical analysis.
 Identifying the weaknesses of the company:
- court cases;
- change in staff: recruitment, reduction, care managers;
- public statements: a comparison of promises andfacts;
- changes in the business model;
- Relations with the sanction countries: Russia, North Korea, Iran;
- the nature of financing: purchase, takeover, credit, receiving investments; - plagiarism.
 Identification of human weaknesses:
- hobby and hobbies, bad habits, tastes;
- sexual preferences, divorce, adultery;
- views: racism, chauvinism, religion, politics;
- 1 and 2 social circles: family and business connections;
- corruption, sources of income, assets;
- public statements, comments on the forums, photos in social. networks and inconsistency to what happened later;
- health status;
- biography and childhood

Looking For:
I am looking for a job where I will have a career opportunity.  I have well-developed analytical skills, I can work and analyze large amounts of information.  Also, I have well developed communication skills, I can defend my point of view.  During the period of work on the project, I learned to find an approach to people, to control the implementation of tasks.  I am ready to learn new things, develop language skills.

Highlights:
I have successfully completed BA courses and am ready to get started. 
As PM at ArtHome startup I've managed a scrum team, created and monitoring the Gantt diagram, communicated with our partners. 

During the period of work at Noosphere there was an opportunity to learn various techniques for finding information.  Compiled reviews on individuals, companies. 

At the Bartolomeo resort I was responsible for the audit of the complex.  During the period of work on the project, I increased the result of staff training from 52% to 93%.

I also worked as an analyst on the global fertilizer market.  Communicated with market players, exchanged information, prepared analytical reports.

