Deep knowledge in networking and firewalling(Routing, switching, VLAN, IPsec, L2TP, OpenVPN, IPS/IDS, DLP, HoneyPots etc).
Adequate TOP management;
Sufficient team of qualified specialists, and if there is none, budget for hiring qualified personnel;
Budget for the servers and software.

