Now my main responsibilities include: 
•development of mutually beneficial relationships with authorized channel partners (including system integrators) in Ukraine to grow HPE market share;
•coordinate and execute the full scope of activities with partners,
driving partner competencies and certification in HPE products
both Technical/Sales, Market Development Funds planning,
education, project management;
•orchestrate available internal resources to support partner
(for instance, pre-sales, education marketing specialists etc.);
